  "Description": {
    "Cost": 6539108,
    "UIName": "Flamberge",
    "Id": "chassisdef_flamberge_FLM-D",
    "Name": "Flamberge",
    "Details": "Developed in the later years of the Jihad by the Jade Falcons, the Flamberge was based on an older experiment involving Partial Wing technology. A 70 ton OmniMech, the Flamberge is built around a 280-rated XL Engine and an Endo Steel chassis with 13.5 tons of armor. 11 DHS are installed as standard, as are a pair of SRM-6's with 35 tons of podspace rounding out the design. The Flamberge D is armed with a  pair of IS Plasma Rifles and 4 Medium pulse Lasers with 4 Jump Jets boosting the designs mobility and 5 extra DHS offsetting the increased heat load.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Targeting - Medium</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.11</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
